To create a folder using cmd:

mkdir-makedirectory

To create folder:
Eg:
  G:\My Drive>mkdir temp
  The above command creates a folder in the My Drive 

To delete folder:
Eg:
   G:\My Drive>rmdir temp
   The above command deletes the folder permanently without moving it in to the recycle bin.

To delete the folder completely including its sub folder:
    G:\My Drive>rmdir /s temp
    G:\My Drive>rmdir /s temp
    temp, Are you sure (Y/N)? Y
    The above command completely deletes the folders including its sub folders permanently without
sending it into the recycle bin.
