To create a file in a folder:
            G:\My Drive\temp>echo > sample.txt
            G:\My Drive\temp>echo > sample.java
            The above create the files sample.txt and sample.java in the temp folder
============================================================================
Attribute for file in cmd:
            G:\My Drive\temp>attrib sample.txt
                     G:\My Drive\temp\sample.txt
            The above shows the characteristics of the file like hidden, archieve etc...
            G:\My Drive\temp>attrib +h sample.txt
            The above command hides the sample.txt file in the temp folder.

            G:\My Drive\temp>attrib sample.txt
    H                G:\My Drive\temp\sample.txt
The above command now shows the sample.txt as a hidden file.

G:\My Drive\temp>attrib +r -h sample.txt

G:\My Drive\temp>attrib sample.txt
                     G:\My Drive\temp\sample.txt
the above commands remove the sample.txt as hidden and makes it as read only.

